   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "image_tag and build share image_files and image_hash, so `easy_sm env` shows exactly the tag the next build produces.\n`easy_sm dockerfile` prints the same dockerfile() text the build would generate; saved as ./Dockerfile it replaces it.\nLibrary errors become a stderr message and exit 1 in one place: fail.",
   "originalText": "image_tag and build share image_files and image_hash, so `easy_sm env` shows exactly the tag the next build produces.\n`easy_sm dockerfile` prints the same dockerfile() text the build would generate; saved as ./Dockerfile it replaces it.\nLibrary errors become a stderr message and exit 1 in one place: fail.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
